WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.060
Wöhler's critics had an escape route: his ammonium cyanate could be traced back to

2
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:14.740
organic sources, so perhaps no organic molecule had truly been made from the

3
00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:19.560
lifeless world. Kolbe's 1845 synthesis slammed that door.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:25.720
He started from carbon disulfide made from charcoal and molten sulfur, with nothing

5
00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:30.920
alive anywhere in the chain and finished the job not with a cell or a seed but with

6
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:34.880
an ordinary galvanic battery, leaving pure acetic acid behind.

7
00:00:35.733 --> 00:00:39.773
Whatever his own motive (he was chiefly proving a theory of how molecules are

8
00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:44.513
built), the effect was decisive: no organic source remained to point to.

9
00:00:45.317 --> 00:00:49.477
That two-carbon acetyl group is now the most trafficked fragment in all of

10
00:00:49.477 --> 00:00:50.037
metabolism.
